<title>NEW ZEALAND: Kopu quits NZ opposition Alliance party - Radio NZ.</title>
<headline>Kopu quits NZ opposition Alliance party - Radio NZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand opposition Alliance MP Alamein Kopu was resigning from the Alliance party to become an independent MP, Radio New Zealand reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The radio said Kopu, a list MP, had ruled out joining junior government coalition partner New Zealand First.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
